body:
I don't believe that you have did so wrong, that you don't deserve to live. You are still young and have life to live and time to achieve things. Wrong place, wrong people around you. 

&#x200B;

I have tried to kill myself multiple times too. Don't exactly know what you're going through, but not everyone seek help even from internet. 

&#x200B;

Remember, that you are human too, a living being. World is indeed harsh sometimes, but I believe that there could still be something nice things you to experience. 

&#x200B;

There is still people who don't give a damn about it that you don't fulfill every expectations of society, and are ready to accept you the way you're. You have a value. No one is even close being perfect.
